imageT -- forms step 8, the first image (Tony, 2026-11-10, SEQ 609). Rows in genLadder/formsPop.sh, registered before the
build. IncantForms/Images/bands.png is the test image kept in the tree: 40 x 20 pixels, the top 5 rows white, below them
four vertical bands 10 wide -- green, red, blue, green. The fit is fill: scaled to cover the frame, centred, cropped.
imSquare (100 x 100) scales it 5x to 200 x 100, so the green bands are cropped away and red and blue each fill half; a
stretch would show green at both edges, and a whole-image fit would leave the top's white above and below. imWide
(100 x 25) scales 2.5x to 100 x 50, so all four bands show and the white top rows are cropped. An image field's text is
its description and is not drawn (SEQ 608). imMissing names no file: refused by name, the field's fill and nothing else.
